                     <handNote/>
                  </handDesc>
                  <bindingDesc>
                     <p>Brown, fine-grained leather over wooden boards, blind-tooled with intricate
                        floral interlace designs.</p>
                     <condition>The original leather covering the boards has been damaged in many
                        places. The manuscript has been rebacked with reddish-brown, fine-grained
                        leather (the replacement spine has no decoration); patches of the same
                        leather has been used for smaller repairs on the upper and lower boards. The
                        current shelfmark is gilt at the base of the spine. Two clasps now
                        missing.</condition>
                  </bindingDesc>
